§ `Article 77(3) and (4): testing, and confidentiality`

-- src:1280 | 3. Where the documentation referred to in paragraph 1 is insufficient to ascertain whether an infringement of obligations under Union law protecting fundamental rights has occurred, the public authority or body referred to in paragraph 1 may make a reasoned request to the market surveillance authority, to organise testing of the high-risk AI system through technical means. The market surveillance authority shall organise the testing with the close involvement of the requesting public authority or body within a reasonable time following the request.
@ref Art 77(3) first sentence (src:1280)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the documentation referred to in paragraph 1 is insufficient to ascertain whether an infringement of obligations under Union law protecting fundamental rights has occurred` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 77(3) first sentence the public authority or body may make a reasoned request to the market surveillance authority to organise testing of the high-risk AI system through technical means` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the documentation referred to in paragraph 1 is insufficient to ascertain whether an infringement of obligations under Union law protecting fundamental rights has occurred`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the documentation referred to in paragraph 1 is insufficient to ascertain whether an infringement ... has occurred, the public authority or body ... may make a reasoned request" (a "may" gated by "where": split site (ii), fork F-77-3-where)

-- src:1280 | 3. Where the documentation referred to in paragraph 1 is insufficient to ascertain whether an infringement of obligations under Union law protecting fundamental rights has occurred, the public authority or body referred to in paragraph 1 may make a reasoned request to the market surveillance authority, to organise testing of the high-risk AI system through technical means. The market surveillance authority shall organise the testing with the close involvement of the requesting public authority or body within a reasonable time following the request.
@ref Art 77(3) first sentence (src:1280)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the documentation referred to in paragraph 1 is insufficient to ascertain whether an infringement of obligations under Union law protecting fundamental rights has occurred` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 77 act`
`Art 77(3) first sentence the public authority's choice to make a reasoned request for testing` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the documentation referred to in paragraph 1 is insufficient to ascertain whether an infringement of obligations under Union law protecting fundamental rights has occurred`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the conditions of the duty are not met
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party national public authority protecting fundamental rights`
        MAY `Art 77(3) make a reasoned request to the market surveillance authority to organise testing of the high-risk AI system through technical means`
        HENCE FULFILLED

-- src:1280 | 3. Where the documentation referred to in paragraph 1 is insufficient to ascertain whether an infringement of obligations under Union law protecting fundamental rights has occurred, the public authority or body referred to in paragraph 1 may make a reasoned request to the market surveillance authority, to organise testing of the high-risk AI system through technical means. The market surveillance authority shall organise the testing with the close involvement of the requesting public authority or body within a reasonable time following the request.
@ref Art 77(3) second sentence (src:1280)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the public authority or body has made a reasoned request under the first sentence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 77(3) second sentence the market surveillance authority must organise the testing with the close involvement of the requesting public authority or body within a reasonable time` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the public authority or body has made a reasoned request under the first sentence`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence is about the testing "following the request" (fork F-77-3-second-duty)

-- src:1280 | 3. Where the documentation referred to in paragraph 1 is insufficient to ascertain whether an infringement of obligations under Union law protecting fundamental rights has occurred, the public authority or body referred to in paragraph 1 may make a reasoned request to the market surveillance authority, to organise testing of the high-risk AI system through technical means. The market surveillance authority shall organise the testing with the close involvement of the requesting public authority or body within a reasonable time following the request.
@ref Art 77(3) second sentence (src:1280)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the public authority or body has made a reasoned request under the first sentence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 77 act`
`Art 77(3) second sentence the market surveillance authority's duty to organise the testing` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the public authority or body has made a reasoned request under the first sentence`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the conditions of the duty are not met
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party market surveillance authority`
        MUST `Art 77(3) organise the testing with the close involvement of the requesting public authority or body within a reasonable time`
        HENCE FULFILLED

-- src:1281 | 4. Any information or documentation obtained by the national public authorities or bodies referred to in paragraph 1 of this Article pursuant to this Article shall be treated in accordance with the confidentiality obligations set out in Article 78.
@ref Art 77(4) (src:1281)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the information or documentation has been obtained by the national public authority or body pursuant to this Article` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 77(4) the information or documentation obtained by the public authority or body is to be treated in accordance with Article 78` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the information or documentation has been obtained by the national public authority or body pursuant to this Article`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence is about "Any information or documentation obtained by the national public authorities or bodies ... pursuant to this Article"

-- src:1281 | 4. Any information or documentation obtained by the national public authorities or bodies referred to in paragraph 1 of this Article pursuant to this Article shall be treated in accordance with the confidentiality obligations set out in Article 78.
@ref Art 77(4) (src:1281)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the information or documentation has been obtained by the national public authority or body pursuant to this Article` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 77 act`
`Art 77(4) the public authority's duty to treat the information in accordance with Article 78` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the information or documentation has been obtained by the national public authority or body pursuant to this Article`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the conditions of the duty are not met
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party national public authority protecting fundamental rights`
        MUST `Art 77(4) treat the information or documentation obtained in accordance with the confidentiality obligations set out in Article 78`
        HENCE FULFILLED
